surname>Mahmud</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Weir</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Downes</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection of replicative integrity in small colonic biopsies using the BrdUrd comet assay</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2003</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>895</fpage><lpage>901</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||88|895||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12644827</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McKelvy-Martin</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name><name><surname>McKeown</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnston</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarthy</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Rahab</surname></name><name><surname>NF</surname></name><name><surname>Downes</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Emerging applications of the single cell gel electrophoresis (comet assay)</article-title><source>Mutagenesis</source><year>1998</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Mutagenesis||13|1||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9491387</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McKenna</surname><given-names>WG</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernard</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Muschel</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulation of radiation-induced apoptosis in oncogene-transfected fibroblasts; influence of H-Ras on the G<sub>2</sub> delay</article-title><source>Oncogene</